"""Phrasings for every AURA action, used to generate fine-tuning data.

COMMANDS maps "agent.action" to (template, params) pairs. `{slot}` is filled from SLOTS; a params
value of "{slot}" takes the same filled value (as an int when the action's hint says int).
Parameters not listed are ones the user did not mention. When an agent gains an action, add its
phrasings here and retrain.
"""

